      en: "A mountain in the North Caribbean region. Mount Killibrin is known for: densely forested, part of the isolated highlands. This region plays an important role in Nicaragua's geography and culture and represents a significant part of the national heritage. Mount Killibrin is part of Nicaragua's cultural heritage."
