      en: "The highest mountain in Nicaragua. Mount Mogotón is known for: located on the border with honduras, elevation 2107 meters. This region plays an important role in Nicaragua's geography and culture and represents a significant part of the national heritage. Mount Mogotón is part of Nicaragua's cultural heritage."
